sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cashier / Manager
    participant S as Service layer<br/>(SaleService, InventoryService)
    participant M as MySQL<br/>(source of truth)
    participant R as Redis<br/>(cache)
    participant P as EventPublisher
    participant B as RabbitMQ<br/>topic exchange
    participant N as NotificationConsumer
    participant G as MongoDB<br/>(notifications)

    C->>S: POST /api/sales (or goods-receiving / adjustment)
    S->>M: validate stock, save Sale + SaleItem + StockMovement
    S->>R: evict product:barcode:* and product:id:* keys
    S->>P: publish DomainEvent (sale.completed / stock.low / ...)
    P->>B: convertAndSend(supermarket.events, routing key)
    B->>N: deliver JSON message to supermarket.notifications
    N->>G: save Notification document (async)
    G-->>C: notification visible in the UI
    Note over P,B: If RabbitMQ is unreachable, EventPublisher applies<br/>the notification directly (synchronous fallback)
